   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「お？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……おぉ！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ほら、言っちゃえ！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んー！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「お……、思いこみなの！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だーいせいかい！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「う、そっ！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:254900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あたしは能力で生まれたわけじゃない」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あんたが『宮代先輩好みの女の子になりたい』と思いつめるあまり、作り上げてしまった人格にすぎない」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でもそれはもう一つの人格があるって、自分自身に暗示をかけてるだけで、どっちもあんたなわけ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ただ、こっちの人格に切り替えている間は『これは私の意志じゃない』って言い訳して、リミッターを解除できる」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だからあんたは、必要に応じてあたしとあんたを切り替えて、宮代先輩へのアプローチを繰り返してたってわけだ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「それがいいことか悪いことかはわからないけど、あたしは別に気にしてないよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だって、あたしはあんたなんだもん」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ちょちょちょちょちょちょちょ、ちょっと待って！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「え、じゃあ、え？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あなた、じゃなくて、わたしがしてきたこれまでのことは……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:255900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「うーん、そうね……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「思い混みが激しすぎて自分自身にエロ暗示をかけちゃった好奇心旺盛な痛い思春期少女、って感じかな」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「はうううっ！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「しししし、しかも、あなたが、わたしだってことは……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あなたがこれまで先輩にしてきたことは……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そういうこと」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あたしが宮代先輩にしてきたことは、ぜーんぶ、元々はあんたがしたかったことよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あんた、実は超むっつりスケベ処女よ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「はわわああああああっ！！！！？？？？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「はうう……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:256900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「しっかりしなさい。こんな所で気を失ったりしないでよね。あたしの体が風邪引いちゃうじゃない」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「それに明日の朝、清掃員か誰かに発見された時になんて言い訳するわけ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「『自分が肉食系女子だったことを知って気絶してました』とか？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ううう、自分にダメ出しされてる……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「え？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「今、『自分』って言ったね。それ良い傾向」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あたしがあんたなんだって、受け入れてる」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あ……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「素直に、単純に考えれば、答えなんてすぐ見つかるのよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:257900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ん……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そう、かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んふ。素直でよろしい」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「なら、もう一個正直になっちゃおうか」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「もう一個？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「宮代先輩のこと、どう思ってるの？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「はわっ！？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「それは、えっと、その……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んんん……！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:258900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「自分自身に嘘をつく必要はないわ。誰も聞いてないんだから」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「どう思ってるのか、聞かせてよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「その……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「拓留、先輩は……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……ん」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「拓留先輩は、わたしに居場所をくれたの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「先輩は、突然新聞部に居ついたわたしを、事情を聞くこともなく受け入れてくれた」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「黙ってエンスーやり続けても、文句言わずにいてくれた」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「わたしが喋りたがらない理由も聞かずにいてくれた」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:259900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「きっと、それは、先輩にとってはなんでもないことなの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「きっと、わたしは部員の数合わせにすぎないの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でも、嬉しかった」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「わたしを必要としてくれて、わたしがしたいことを尊重してくれることが嬉しかった」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「それに、拓留先輩は、優しい人なの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「普段はすっごく偉そうだし、みんなをバカにするような言い方しかしないけど、本当は凄く優しい人なの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:260500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
